WEBVTT

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.238
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Excuse me, miss.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.111
Is this your phone?

00:00:05.696 --> 00:00:09.275
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Oh! Yes, it is.

00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:11.296
Thank you very much.

00:00:11.562 --> 00:00:12.467
<v><b>Man:</b></v> You’re welcome.

00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:14.995
It’s a very nice phone!

00:00:15.804 --> 00:00:16.823
The new iPhone.

00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:20.239
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Sorry? Oh yes.

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:22.684
<v><b>Man:</b></v> A souvenir for your family?

00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:25.955
A football shirt is only £25!

00:00:27.312 --> 00:00:28.428
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> OK.

00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:32.369
An Arsenal football shirt, please.

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:34.013
<v><b>Man:</b></v> And a T-shirt?

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.933
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Yes, and a T-shirt!